# s13 — rank-ties fixture (mirrors demos/4-order/045-rank-ties.bqn)
# 3 units, all selected; the .bqn's Unit mask is implicit/all-ones, materialized here for the surface's Unit
n 3
col unit bool 1 1 1
col gold num 5 5 3
col rank num -1 -1 -1
# the .bqn's equivariance permutation (BQN-only witness; inert here, kept as the decision record)
bind p vec 1 0 2
ja 部隊 unit
ja 金 gold
ja 順位 rank
